{"outcome":"component","existing":"","reason":"","code":"OrderStepsFaq","label":"Order steps and FAQ","description":"The steps of an order in sequence, followed by delivery questions that open to show their answers, in one section. Use it on a delivery, shipping or ordering help page that explains how an order goes and answers common delivery questions.","props":"[{"name": "steps_title", "type": "text", "label": "Steps heading", "max": 120}, {"name": "steps", "type": "items", "label": "Steps", "min": 2, "max": 8, "items": [{"name": "title", "type": "text", "label": "Step", "required": true, "max": 80}, {"name": "text", "type": "text", "label": "What happens", "max": 300}]}, {"name": "faq_title", "type": "text", "label": "Questions heading", "max": 120}, {"name": "questions", "type": "items", "label": "Questions", "min": 1, "max": 12, "items": [{"name": "question", "type": "text", "label": "Question", "required": true, "max": 200}, {"name": "answer", "type": "html", "label": "Answer", "required": true}]}, {"name": "one_open", "type": "boolean", "label": "Keep one answer open at a time", "help": "Opening a question closes the one that was open.", "default": true}, {"name": "open_first", "type": "boolean", "label": "Open the first answer", "default": false}]","sample":"{"steps_title": "Comment se passe votre commande", "steps": [{"title": "Vous commandez", "text": "Ajoutez vos articles au panier et réglez en ligne en toute sécurité."}, {"title": "Nous préparons", "text": "Votre colis est préparé dans notre atelier sous 24 heures ouvrées."}, {"title": "Nous expédions", "text": "Vous recevez un e-mail avec le numéro de suivi dès le départ du colis."}, {"title": "Vous recevez", "text": "Le transporteur vous livre à domicile ou en point relais."}], "faq_title": "Questions sur la livraison", "questions": [{"question": "Quels sont les délais de livraison ?", "answer": "<p>Comptez 2 à 3 jours ouvrés en France métropolitaine après l’expédition.</p>"}, {"question": "Combien coûte la livraison ?", "answer": "<p>La livraison coûte 4,90 € en point relais et 6,90 € à domicile. Elle est offerte dès 60 € d’achat.</p>"}, {"question": "Comment suivre mon colis ?", "answer": "<p>Le lien de suivi se trouve dans l’e-mail d’expédition et dans votre espace client.</p>"}, {"question": "Que se passe-t-il si je suis absent ?", "answer": "<p>Le transporteur laisse un avis de passage. Votre colis vous attend au point relais le plus proche pendant 10 jours.</p>"}, {"question": "Livrez-vous hors de France ?", "answer": "<p>Oui, nous livrons en Belgique, en Suisse et au Luxembourg sous 4 à 6 jours ouvrés.</p>"}], "one_open": true, "open_first": false}","template":"<section class="order-help"><div class="order-help__part">{% if props.steps_title is not empty %}<h2 class="order-help__title">{{ props.steps_title }}</h2>{% endif %}<ol class="order-steps">{% for step in props.steps %}<li class="order-step"><h3 class="order-step__title">{{ step.title }}</h3>{% if step.text is not empty %}<p class="order-step__text">{{ step.text }}</p>{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}</ol></div>{% if props.questions is not empty %}<div class="order-help__part">{% if props.faq_title is not empty %}<h2 class="order-help__title">{{ props.faq_title }}</h2>{% endif %}<div class="order-faq">{% for item in props.questions %}<details class="order-faq__item"{% if props.one_open %} name="order-help-faq"{% endif %}{% if loop.first and props.open_first %} open{% endif %}><summary class="order-faq__question">{{ item.question }}</summary><div class="order-faq__answer">{{ item.answer }}</div></details>{% endfor %}</div></div>{% endif %}</section>","css":".order-help { display: grid; gap: 2.5rem; }
.order-help__title { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: var(--cms-color-text); }
.order-steps { display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; counter-reset: order-step; }
.order-step { counter-increment: order-step; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 2px solid var(--cms-color-accent); }
.order-step__title { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1.125rem; color: var(--cms-color-text); }
.order-step__title::before { content: counter(order-step) ". "; color: var(--cms-color-accent-strong); }
.order-step__text { margin: 0; color: var(--cms-color-text-muted); }
.order-faq { border-top: 1px solid var(--cms-color-border); }
.order-faq__item { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--cms-color-border); }
.order-faq__question { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; padding: 1rem 0; font-weight: 600; color: var(--cms-color-text); cursor: pointer; list-style: none; }
.order-faq__question::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
.order-faq__question::after { content: "+"; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1; color: var(--cms-color-accent); }
.order-faq__item[open] > .order-faq__question::after { content: "−"; }
.order-faq__question:hover { color: var(--cms-color-accent-strong); }
.order-faq__question:focus-visible { color: var(--cms-color-accent-strong); outline: 2px solid var(--cms-color-accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
.order-faq__answer { padding: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--cms-color-text-muted); }
.order-faq__answer > :first-child { margin-top: 0; }
.order-faq__answer > :last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) { .order-faq__question { transition: color 0.2s ease; } }
@media (min-width: 48rem) { .order-help { gap: 3.5rem; } .order-steps { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(12rem, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; } }"}
